  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td bgcolor="#FFFFFF">
	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P>From our French correspondent <STRONG>Claudine</STRONG>:</P>
<P>Sympathetic <STRONG>MADONNA</STRONG>. <STRONG>Valeria Attinelli</STRONG>, the girl who designed the clothing line worn by&nbsp;<STRONG>Madonna</STRONG>'s daughter <STRONG>Lourdes</STRONG>, could not have a ticket to see the star singing at <STRONG>Paris Bercy</STRONG>. <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> then sent a mail of special reservation to her and at the place where it was necessary to register a number of Bleue card we could read : <STRONG>"Paid by Madonna".</STRONG></P>
<P align=center><IMG src="/images/francia/Gala_Attinelli.jpg" border=0></P>
<P align=center>From this week issue of&nbsp;<STRONG>Gala</STRONG></P>
</font></div>
