	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P><STRONG>Jerusalem:</STRONG></P>
<P>&nbsp;<STRONG>Israel would present material girl, Madonna, with an oil lamp and coin from the Byzantine period during her three day visit on Rosh Hashana (Jewish new year) to pursue her new found interest in Kabbalah - Jewish mysticism. </STRONG></P>
<P>Israel is attaching a lot of importance to the visit which it thinks would bring back the eluding tourists to the country wrecked by four years of incessant violence. <BR><BR></P>
